🚗🔋 Built a small EV battery simulation in MATLAB

Recently, I tried to understand how battery charge changes over time in an electric vehicle. So I created a simple model to simulate **State of Charge (SOC)** using different numerical methods.

I compared:

* Euler method
* Heun (Improved Euler)
* RK4
* RK45 (ode45 in MATLAB)

It was interesting to see how accuracy improves from Euler → RK methods, especially when the current changes over time.

This gave me a better understanding of how simulations are actually used in EV systems before real implementation.

Still exploring more in this area — especially Simulink and real-world models.

